FlClash
=======
Project: FlClash
Source: https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash
Upstream version inspected: 0.9.2+2026102401 (main)
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE)

Two motion techniques were adapted from FlClash, not copied wholesale:

1. lib/ui/drag_overlay.dart - a single-child render object that positions a
   drag ghost by translating a retained composited layer, so a pointer move
   repaints instead of rebuilding and re-laying out the overlay. Adapted from
   FlClash's render-object approach in lib/ui/goo.dart and
   lib/ui/navigation_dock.dart.
2. lib/ui/motion.dart - SpringCurve, a Curve backed by a SpringSimulation plus
   a residual term so the curve lands exactly on 1.0. Adapted from FlClash's
   lib/ui/motion.dart.

Modifications: both are rewritten for this app's widget set, naming and
reduced-motion handling; no FlClash theme, styling, asset or business logic
was taken. FlClash is free software under GPL-3.0, the same license this
project is distributed under; the complete license text is in LICENSE.